Bugfix: Redact Swift backend password in debug log output

The OpenStack password (set via OS_PASSWORD or ST_KEY) was stored as a
plain string in the Swift backend Config struct. When debug logging was
enabled via the DEBUG_LOG environment variable, restic wrote the full
Config struct to the log file using %#v, exposing the password in clear
text. The password is now stored as an options.SecretString, consistent
with AuthToken and ApplicationCredentialSecret, and is redacted to
"**redacted**" in any formatted output.

https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22007
